tion\":\"Creates a dreamy glowing haze portrait.\"},{\"title\":\"Showcase\",\"imagePrompt\":\"Using the uploaded product image as reference, create a crisp photoreal product hero shot on a smooth, minimal gradient backdrop (subtle tonal shift, not colorful rainbow). Soft studio lighting with one large diffused key light and gentle fill; clean shadow under the product; faint highlight edge that matches its material. No props, no clutter. Product proportions and branding must remain exact and readable. Shot like high-end ecommerce photography, 70mm lens look, tack-sharp details, neutral color accuracy. Provide ample negative space for storefront layout.\",\"videoPrompt\":\"Very subtle cinematic pan to the right, keeping the object centered in the frame throughout. Steady, smooth, aesthetic.\",\"templateType\":\"I2I2V\",\"videoPreviewURL\":\"https://imagine-public.x.ai/imagine-public/share-videos/7b097052-8cfe-4b0f-8a33-c2a71e1aed25.mp4\",\"postID\":\"7b097052-8cfe-4b0f-8a33-c2a71e1aed25\",\"description\":\"Creates a clean studio product photo with soft lighting and a smooth pan.\"},{\"title\":\"Roman Empire\",\"imagePrompt\":\"$8f\",\"templateType\":\"I2I\",\"postID\":\"9d8f6c8e-3507-4f38-a022-3c14f6fbbd91\",\"description\":\"Travel back in time to the age of great Roman Emperors.\"},{\"title\":\"Fire Horse\",\"imagePrompt\":\"Subject is riding on a beautiful vibrantly red giant porcelain horse, positioned in front of the great wall of china. Slightly grainy film texture. Low dramatic epic angle. Beautiful framing. High resolution, up close framing of subject upper body. Low light background. Subject has a neutral facial expression.\",\"videoPrompt\":\"Horse begins galloping, background becomes darker and golden/yellow fireworks go off in background.\",\"templateType\":\"I2I2V\",\"postID\":\"808ab93b-ec7f-4052-964b-5174c908db1d\",\"description\":\"Rides a giant red porcelain horse galloping by the Great Wall with fireworks.\"},{\"title\":\"Video Game\",\"imagePrompt\":\"A character rendered in authentic early-2000s PlayStation 2 / Nintendo 64 video game style, with very low-poly geometry, blocky limbs, and angular facial features. The character has simple, flat textures, visible texture stretching, and low-resolution diffuse maps, with no skin pores, no fine detail, and no realism.\",\"templateType\":\"I2I\",\"postID\":\"f51ad8c5-9dfa-4436-8c5a-9f0e95f78483\",\"description\":\"Turns life into a video game.\"},{\"title\":\"Ad Astra\",\"imagePrompt\":\"The subjects are suspended in space, wearing spacesuits. Retain likeness and any original head accessories if present. Entire image is black and white.\",\"videoPrompt\":\"They are gently floating through space, subtly happy and in awe.\",\"templateType\":\"I2I2V\",\"postID\":\"9068fa4b-4805-467c-b2d3-0cb503356052\",\"description\":\"Floats you through space in a black-and-white spacesuit.\"},{\"title\":\"Balloon Flight\",\"imagePrompt\":\"Turn the core characters from the image into inflated, glossy vinyl Balloons figure with huge, oversized eyes, gently floating and rising up into the sky. The balloons only have the overinflated, rounded upper body and arms. A thread holds the bottom of the balloon. Highly reflective smooth plastic surface, subtle seam lines, gentle pressure wrinkles, shiny toy-like finish, soft, inflated human face with slightly simplified features, cinematic studio lighting, centered portrait, ultra-detailed, polished inflatable character aesthetic， medium close-up shot.\",\"videoPrompt\":\"The printed eyes of balloons are static; the balloons float purely upward; the balloons themselves are completely rigid, devoid of any movement. The camera tracks the balloon statically, ensuring it remains centered within the center of the frame.\",\"templateType\":\"I2I2V\",\"postID\":\"3075a66c-40f6-47ed-b86a-6a649a7bdf0b\",\"description\":\"Turn yourself into a balloon and rise high into the sky.\"},{\"title\":\"Go Skiing\",\"imagePrompt\":\"Subjects skiing down a snowy mountain. Preserve outfit.\",\"videoPrompt\":\"Skiing in a zigzag carving motion.\",\"templateType\":\"I2I2V\",\"postID\":\"099aeb0e-6221-4a45-889c-f90b6626a627\",\"description\":\"Skiing down a snowy mountain carving turns.\"},{\"title\":\"Laser Fight\",\"imagePrompt\":\"the subjects each hold a blue, futuristic lightsaber sword in their hands\",\"videoPrompt\":\"the characters start fighting with the lightsaber in a controlled, elegant way. cinematic darkness emerges.\",\"templateType\":\"I2I2V\",\"postID\":\"c9614d47-b75d-40c2-b9cf-97394c099b9d\",\"description\":\"Fights with glowing blue lightsabers.\"},{\"postID\":\"468c842f-26c3-4f08-8d50-ee3e6b60b1b1\",\"title\":\"Future Family\",\"prompt\":\"Add their children looking like them and dressed similarly.\",\"description\":\"Adds kids who look like you.\"},{\"postID\":\"7be5f03e-0484-4a12-aad7-f14159820ffa\",\"title\":\"Club Beats\",\"prompt\":\"Create a short video animation starting from the uploaded static image of a person. The subject(s) begins without any accessories, facing forward with a neutral expression. Smoothly animate them reaching up and putting on large black visor-style sunglasses that cover their eyes completely, followed by sliding on bulky over-ear headphones or ear protectors. Once equipped, have them start nodding their head rhythmically to upbeat music, with subtle body sways, maintaining a cool, intense vibe like a video game character. Cinematic lighting illuminates the face of the subject and the camera dolly's in as the subject continues bopping their head, keeping the body movement realistic and fluid.\",\"description\":\"Puts on sunglasses and headphones then grooves to club beats.\"},{\"title\":\"Simulationship\",\"imagePrompt\":\"The subject is running in a field with a few flowers, ultra grainy and low saturation 90's film aesthetic retro, holding the hand of silhouette figure that has a vintage neon green grid pattern (almost like a simulation character), they are running through a grassy field on a sunny day, a few flowers in the field. Both subjects are joyous.\",\"videoPrompt\":\"Subjects continue holding hands playfully running through the grass, almost dream-like.\",\"templateType\":\"I2I2V\",\"postID\":\"117cd5d1-ba11-4e93-bd93-160c4f92babf\",\"description\":\"Runs hand-in-hand through a flower field with a glowing simulation figure.\"},{\"postID\":\"ad4741bf-8f64-43f8-bba4-9097b5b5a14d\",\"title\":\"Let it Snow\",\"prompt\":\"A powdery snowball thrown at the subject hitting them in their face, snowball bursting into powdery snow on impact. Funny and harmless. The character looks slightly upset looking in the direction from where the snowball came and calling toward that direction at someone beyond the camera.\",\"description\":\"Gets hit in the face by a snowball.\"},{\"postID\":\"55c2e33d-94f1-49e2-bee4-0984cb28e7be\",\"title\":\"Bear Buddy\",\"prompt\":\"A giant alive and real polar bear walks up to the subject sitting next to the subject, and the subject pats the bear as the bear softly snuggles the subject. One continuous shot, no cuts.\",\"description\":\"Cuddles with a giant friendly polar bear.\"},{\"postID\":\"3c36fe5c-01ce-4a74-8102-d8eaa8443e66\",\"title\":\"Cuddle a Squirrel\",\"prompt\":\"A little squirrel runs up the shoulder of the subject, and they touch noses softly and sweetly.\",\"description\":\"A squirrel climbs your shoulder for a nose touch.\"},{\"postID\":\"7a668278-27c6-497e-96ea-552740c4ab15\",\"title\":\"Helicopter Escape\",\"prompt\":\"A rescue rope drops from above as the subject grabs it and vanishes skyward. Action-packed, cinematic getaway\",\"description\":\"Grabs a rope and escapes by helicopter.\"},{\"title\":\"Sunny Morning\",\"imagePrompt\":\"$90\",\"templateType\":\"I2I\",\"postID\":\"7ad8ee24-d5d5-4688-84bb-b221cddc5dd7\",\"description\":\"Warm golden-hour morning scene with film look.\"}]},\"enable_settings_subscription_section_v2\":true,\"show_early_access_models_setting\":false,\"require_connect