"imageInputs\":[],\"coverImageUrl\":\"https://media.x.ai/v1/grok-web/text_edit_thumb-9ed8f705.png\",\"coverVideoUrl\":\"https://media.x.ai/v1/grok-web/text_edit-71231b8a.mp4\",\"coverDimensions\":{\"width\":960,\"height\":960}},{\"id\":\"segment-photo\",\"title\":\"Precise Edit\",\"promptTemplate\":\"\",\"textInputs\":[],\"imageInputs\":[],\"coverImageUrl\":\"https://media.x.ai/v1/grok-web/precise_edit_thumb-6671fd53.png\",\"coverVideoUrl\":\"https://media.x.ai/v1/grok-web/precise_edit-e8ec5d39.mp4\",\"coverDimensions\":{\"width\":1400,\"height\":1400}},{\"id\":\"imagine-photo-edit\",\"title\":\"Photo Edit\",\"description\":\"Upload a photo and pick one precise edit — enhance, remove an object, professional polish, change the background, isolate a person, black \u0026 white, cozy warm, sharpen details, or blur the background.\",\"category\":\"Photo Tools\",\"settings\":[{\"label\":\"Mode\",\"value\":\"Image Editing\"}],\"presetInputs\":[{\"id\":\"edit\",\"label\":\"Edit\",\"description\":\"Pick exactly one edit to apply to your photo.\",\"required\":true,\"multiSelect\":false,\"options\":[{\"label\":\"Photo enhance\",\"imageUrl\":\"https://imagine-public.x.ai/agent-skills/photo_edit/photo_edit_photo_enhance.jpg?v=3\",\"value\":\"Photo enhance\",\"prompt\":\"Dramatically improve this photo into a polished, professional-quality portrait while keeping the same person, same pose, same clothing, and same location. Re-light the subject with flattering soft directional key light and gentle fill so the face is bright, dimensional, and clearly separated from the background — eliminate flat, dull, or overhead lighting. Add depth of field: render the background with natural, creamy optical blur so the subject pops, and clean up background clutter and distracting bright spots. Apply a rich, film-like color grade with deep clean blacks, luminous highlights, and vivid but natural color.\\n\\nCritical constraints: preserve the person's exact same face, eyes, skin and appearance.\"},{\"label\":\"Remove Object\",\"imageUrl\":\"https://imagine-public.x.ai/agent-skills/photo_edit/photo_edit_remove_object.jpg?v=5\",\"value\":\"Remove Object\",\"prompt\":\"Remove the specific unwanted object or person the user describes. Fill the area naturally so it looks like the object was never there. Preserve the exact appearance of the person that's the main subject of the photo. Do not change anything about them, just remove the object they want to remove.\"},{\"label\":\"Professional Polish\",\"imageUrl\":\"https://imagine-public.x.ai/agent-skills/photo_edit/photo_edit_professional_polish.jpg?v=1\",\"value\":\"Professional Polish\",\"prompt\":\"Transform this casual photo into a polished, professional-quality portrait of the exact same person, clothing, jewelry, and location. Re-light the subject with soft directional key light from a flattering angle plus gentle fill so their face is bright, dimensional, and clearly separated from the background, eliminating flat or overhead lighting. Add natural creamy optical depth of field that renders the background with smooth bokeh blur, cleaning up clutter and distracting bright spots so the subject pops forward. Apply a rich film-like color grade featuring deep clean blacks, luminous highlights, and vivid yet natural colors. The final image must look like the same person captured by a professional photographer with excellent lighting and a fast lens.\"},{\"label\":\"Background Changer\",\"imageUrl\":\"https://imagine-public.x.ai/agent-skills/photo_edit/photo_edit_background_changer.jpg?v=6\",\"value\":\"Background Changer\",\"prompt\":\"Replace the entire background with a new one that the user describes. Keep the main subject sharp and correctly lit for the new background. Make sure that the proportion of the main subject of the picture is logical compared to the background proportions so the main subject does not lok overly big or overly small compared to the new background.\"},{\"label\":\"Isolate Person\",\"imageUrl\":\"https://imagine-public.x.ai/agent-skills/photo_edit/photo_edit_isolate_person.jpg?v=5\",\"value\":\"Isolate Person\",\"prompt\":\"Isolate the person the user describes into a portrait of them in the same setting but by themselves. Remove everyone else just keep the original setting and the close up portrait of the person. If the person is wearing anything on their face, keep it exactly the same. Maintain their facial features precisely.\"},{\"label\":\"Black \u0026 White\",\"imageUrl\":\"https://imagine-public.x.ai/agent-skills/photo_edit/photo_edit_black_and_white.jpg?v=3\",\"value\":\"Black \u0026 White\",\"prompt\":\"$92\"},{\"label\":\"Cozy Warm\",\"imageUrl\":\"https://imagine-public.x.ai/agent-skills/photo_edit/photo_edit_cozy_warm.jpg?v=3\",\"value\":\"Cozy Warm\",\"prompt\":\"$93\"},{\"label\":\"Sharpen Details\",\"imageUrl\":\"https://imagine-public.x.ai/agent-skills/photo_edit/photo_edit_sharpen_details.jpg?v=4\",\"value\":\"Sharpen Details\",\"prompt\":\"Increase sharpness, texture, and micro-contrast throughout the image for crisper, more defined details. Enhance edge definition and fine detail in the hair, clothing, eyes, and background while keeping the overall look natural and realistic. Do not change colors, tones, lighting, composition, or the subject's appearance beyond the added clarity and sharpness.\"},{\"label\":\"Blur Background\",\"imageUrl\":\"https://imagine-public.x.ai/agent-skills/photo_edit/photo_edit_blur_background.jpg?v=1\",\"value\":\"Blur Background\",\"prompt\":\"Keep the main subject sharp and add natural background blur/bokeh.\"}]}],\"textInputs\":[{\"id\":\"details\",\"label\":\"Details\",\"required\":false,\"placeholder\":\"e.g. remove the cars / change background to a beach — needed only for Remove Object, Background Changer, or Isolate Person\"}],\"imageInputs\":[{\"id\":\"photo\",\"label\":\"Your photo\",\"required\":true,\"minImages\":1,\"maxImages\":1}],\"inputOrder\":[\"photo\",\"edit\",\"details\"],\"promptTem