 oversized headphones, music notes around\\nNOTLIKETHIS - despair: both hands clasped on top of the head, mouth open in a silent scream, eyes to the sky\",\"imageUrl\":\"https://imagine-public.x.ai/agent-skills/emoji_creator/pack_meme.jpg?v=2\"},{\"label\":\"Custom\",\"value\":\"custom\",\"prompt\":\"CUSTOM PACK: create exactly the expressions listed under 'Extra notes' below - one emote per listed item, following each item's description literally\",\"imageUrl\":\"https://imagine-public.x.ai/agent-skills/emoji_creator/pack_custom.jpg?v=2\"}]},{\"id\":\"style\",\"label\":\"Style\",\"required\":true,\"options\":[{\"label\":\"Chibi cartoon\",\"value\":\"chibi\",\"prompt\":\"chibi cartoon style: oversized head, tiny or no body, bold clean dark outlines, flat cel shading, bright saturated colors\",\"imageUrl\":\"https://imagine-public.x.ai/agent-skills/emoji_creator/style_chibi.jpg?v=3\"},{\"label\":\"Kawaii pastel\",\"value\":\"kawaii\",\"prompt\":\"kawaii pastel style: extra-round simplified shapes, soft pastel palette with high contrast between them, big sparkly eyes, rosy blush circles on the cheeks, tiny sparkle accents, clean bold outlines\",\"imageUrl\":\"https://imagine-public.x.ai/agent-skills/emoji_creator/style_kawaii.jpg?v=3\"},{\"label\":\"Pixel art\",\"value\":\"pixel\",\"prompt\":\"TRUE RETRO PIXEL ART - mandatory rendering rules, not a mood: draw the emote as if on a tiny 48x48 pixel grid and then enlarged, so the whole image is built from big, visible, hard-edged SQUARE pixels; every contour stair-steps - no smooth curves, no anti-aliasing, no gradients, no soft or painterly shading anywhere; a flat limited palette of roughly 16 solid colors, with at most simple two-tone dithering for shade; it must look like a video-game sprite from a 1990s console. If any part of the image looks like a smooth cartoon, the style is wrong\",\"imageUrl\":\"https://imagine-public.x.ai/agent-skills/emoji_creator/style_pixel.jpg?v=3\"},{\"label\":\"Flat sticker\",\"value\":\"sticker\",\"prompt\":\"flat die-cut sticker style: completely FLAT vector artwork - solid one-tone color fills only, zero gradients, zero shading, zero highlights, zero texture; simple bold geometric shapes with clean dark outlines; and the signature feature: a THICK solid-white die-cut sticker border of uniform width tracing the entire outer silhouette, like a sticker just peeled off its sheet - the white border must be clearly visible around the whole emote\",\"imageUrl\":\"https://imagine-public.x.ai/agent-skills/emoji_creator/style_sticker.jpg?v=3\"},{\"label\":\"3D clay\",\"value\":\"clay\",\"prompt\":\"3D claymation style: the subject sculpted from real matte plasticine like a stop-motion movie character - chunky hand-molded rounded forms with softly uneven surfaces, visible fingerprint smudges and subtle sculpting-tool marks in the clay; photographed with soft dimensional studio lighting that gives real depth and soft shadows; it must read as a photo of a physical clay figurine - never a flat drawing, never a smooth glossy 3D render\",\"imageUrl\":\"https://imagine-public.x.ai/agent-skills/emoji_creator/style_clay.jpg?v=3\"}]}],\"textInputs\":[{\"id\":\"notes\",\"label\":\"Notes (optional — required for the Custom pack)\",\"required\":false,\"multiline\":true,\"placeholder\":\"Anything specific you want. For the Custom pack, list your expressions here, one per line, e.g.:\\nSIP - smug sideways glance while sipping from a tiny mug\\nBONK - eyes shut tight, comic bonk with a paper fan overhead\"}],\"imageInputs\":[{\"id\":\"subjectImage\",\"label\":\"Your face, pet, or mascot\",\"description\":\"One clear photo of the subject the emotes should be based on — a face, a pet, or a mascot/logo character.\",\"required\":true,\"minImages\":1,\"maxImages\":1}],\"inputOrder\":[\"subjectImage\",\"pack\",\"style\",\"notes\"],\"promptTemplate\":\"$a0\",\"variants\":[{\"inputs\":\"https://imagine-public.x.ai/agent-skills/emoji_creator/variants/EMC-01-input.jpg?v=20260723\",\"output\":\"https://imagine-public.x.ai/agent-skills/emoji_creator/variants/EMC-01-output.jpg?v=20260723\"},{\"inputs\":\"https://imagine-public.x.ai/agent-skills/emoji_creator/variants/EMC-04-input.jpg?v=20260723\",\"output\":\"https://imagine-public.x.ai/agent-skills/emoji_creator/variants/EMC-04-output.jpg\"},{\"inputs\":\"https://imagine-public.x.ai/agent-skills/emoji_creator/variants/EMC-11-input.jpg?v=20260723\",\"output\":\"https://imagine-public.x.ai/agent-skills/emoji_creator/variants/EMC-11-output.jpg\"},{\"inputs\":\"https://imagine-public.x.ai/agent-skills/emoji_creator/variants/EMC-37-input.jpg?v=20260723\",\"output\":\"https://imagine-public.x.ai/agent-skills/emoji_creator/variants/EMC-37-output.jpg\"},{\"inputs\":\"https://imagine-public.x.ai/agent-skills/emoji_creator/variants/EMC-40-input.jpg?v=20260723\",\"output\":\"https://imagine-public.x.ai/agent-skills/emoji_creator/variants/EMC-40-output.jpg?v=20260723\"}]},{\"id\":\"imagine-ugc-photos\",\"title\":\"UGC Photos\",\"description\":\"Turn product reference photos into 6 authentic UGC-style phone snapshots, each with a different person and setting.\",\"category\":\"Marketing\",\"coverImageUrl\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/imagine-public.x.ai/agent-skills/ugc_image/Inluencer%201_16x9.png?v=3\",\"coverVerticalImageUrl\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/imagine-public.x.ai/agent-skills/ugc_image/Influencer%201_2x3.jpg?v=1\",\"settings\":[{\"label\":\"Aspect\",\"value\":\"9:16\"}],\"imageInputs\":[{\"id\":\"product\",\"label\":\"Product photos\",\"description\":\"Multi-angle photos of the product — more angles, more accuracy.\",\"required\":true,\"minImages\":1,\"maxImages\":8}],\"presetInputs\":[{\"id\":\"size\",\"label\":\"Product size\",\"description\":\"How big is the product in real life? Pick the closest — it sets how large the product is rendered relative to hands, faces and furniture. Choose one.\",\"required\":true,\"options\":[{\"label\":\"Pocket-size\",\"value\":\"Pocket-size\",\"prompt\":\"Pocket-size — small enough that a closed hand mostly hides it; fingers wrap all the way around it and it slips into a pocket (a lip balm, a ring box, an earbuds case, a keychain trinket). Render it this small; never enlarge it to show detail.\",\"imageUrl\":\"https://imagine-public.x.ai/agent-skills/ugc_photos/ugc-size-1-pocket.png?v=2\"},{\"label\":\"Handheld\",\"value\":\"Handheld\",\"prompt\":\"Handheld — sits in one open palm and is gripped in a single hand without being fully enclosed; roughly palm-to-forearm length (a smartphone, a soda can, a serum bottle, a coffee mug, a TV remote).\",\"imageUrl\":\"https://imagine-public.x.ai/agent-skills/ugc_photos/ugc-size-2-handheld.png?v=2\"},{\"label\":\"Medium\",\"value\":\"Medium\",\"prompt\":\"Medium — too big for one hand to enclose; naturally held with two hands or cradled against a forearm, noticeably larger than a single palm (a kettle, a boot, a plush toy, a shoebox, a table lamp).\",\"imageUrl\":\"https://imagine-public.x.ai/agent-skills/ugc_photos/ugc-size-3-medium.png?v=2\"},{\"label\":\"Large\",\"value\":\"Large\",\"prompt\":\"Large — clearly dwarfs the hand; carried against the body or set on the floor or a table rather than held up to the camera (a backpack, a small appliance, a duffel bag, a floor cushion).\",\"imageUrl\":\"https://imagine-public.x.ai/agent-skills/ugc_photos/ugc-size-4-large.png?v=2\"},{\"label\":\"Oversized\",\"value\":\"Oversized\",\"prompt\":\"Oversized — furniture- or appliance-scale; a person stands beside, holds a corner of, or leans on it and a hand covers only a small fraction of its surface (an armchair, a suitcase, a large monitor, a piece of luggage).\",\"imageUrl\":\"https://imagine-public.x.ai/agent-skills/ugc_photos/ugc-size-5-oversized.png?v=2\"}]}],\"textInputs\":[{\"id\":\"custom_size\",\"label\":\"Exact size (optional)\",\"required\":false,\"placeholder\":\"e.g. 12 oz can, ~15 cm tall; or 'fits in a palm'\"},{\"id\":\"vibe\",\"label\":\"Brand vibe (optional)\",\"required\":false,\"placeholder\":\"e.g. cozy morning routine, gym bag essential\"}],\"inputOrder\":[\"product\",\"size\",\"custom_size\",\"vibe\"],\"promptTemplate\":\"$a1\",\"variants\":[{\"inputs\":\"https://imagine-public.x.ai/agent-skills/ugc_image/variants/UGC-18-input.jpg\",\"output\":\"https://imagine-public.x.ai/agent-skills/ugc_image/variants/UGC-18-output.jpg\"},{\"inputs\":\"https://imagine-public.x.ai/agent-skills/ugc_image/variants/UGC-19-input.jpg\",\"output\":\"https://imagine-public.x.ai/agent-skills/ugc_image/variants/UGC-19-output.jpg\"},{\"inputs\":\"https://imagine-public.x.ai/agent-skills/ugc_image/variants/UGC-37-input.jpg?v=20260723\",\"output\":\"https://imagine-public.x.ai/agent-skills/ugc_image/variants/UGC-37-output.jpg\"},{\"inputs\":\"https://imagine-public.x.ai/agent-skills/ugc_image/variants/UGC-15-input.jpg\",\"output\":\"https://imagine-public.x.ai/agent-skills/ugc_image/variants/UGC-15-output.jpg\"},{\"inputs\":\"https://imagine-public.x.ai/agent-skills/ugc_image/variants/UGC-21-input.jpg?v=20260723\",\"output\":\"https://imagine-public.x.ai/agent-skills/ugc_image/variants/UGC-21-output.jpg?v=20260723\"}]},{\"id\":\"imagine-mascot-maker\",\"title\":\"Mascot Maker\",\"description\":\"Turn a one-line concept into an original, production-ready game mascot: one full-body character with a strong iconic silhouette, a memorable color identity, and tons of personality — centered on a keyable (transparent) background, sprite-base ready. Pairs naturally with Character Sprite Maker to animate your mascot into engine-ready sprite sheets.\",\"category\":\"Design Tools\",\"coverImageUrl\":\"https://imagine-public.x.ai/agent-skills/mascot_maker/mascot_maker_cover.jpg?v=5\",\"coverVerticalImageUrl\":\"https://imagine-public.x.ai/agent-skills/mascot_maker/mascot_maker_vertical.jpg?v=3\",\"settings\":[{\"label\":\"Mode\",\"value\":\"Image\"},{\"label\":\"Options\",\"value\":\"1\"},{\"label\":\"Images\",\"value\":\"0\"}],\"presetInputs\":[{\"id\":\"art_style\",\"label\":\"Style\",\"description\":\"The art style for your mascot. Leave unset for the polished 2D game-mascot look.\",\"default\":\"game-mascot\",\"options\":[{\"label\":\"Polished 2D game mascot\",\"value\":\"game-mascot\",\"prompt\":\"game-mascot: polished 2D game mascot art — bold clean dark outlines, vibrant saturated colors, soft cel shading, chunky readable shapes, big expressive eyes, high contrast, crisp edges, no photorealism.\",\"imageUrl\":\"https://imagine-public.x.ai/agent-skills/mascot_maker/style_game_mascot.jpg?v=3\"},{\"label\":\"Chibi cute\",\"value\":\"chibi\",\"prompt\":\"chibi: cute chibi proportions — oversized head, tiny body, maximum charm.\",\"imageUrl\":\"https://imagine-public.x.ai/agent-skills/mascot_maker/style_chibi.jpg?v=3\"},{\"label\":\"Retro cartoon\",\"value\":\"retro-cartoon\",\"prompt\":\"retro-cartoon: rubber-hose / classic-cartoon energy, bold and bouncy.\",\"imageUrl\":\"https://imagine-public.x.ai/agent-skills/mascot_maker/style_retro_cartoon.jpg?v=3\"},{\"label\":\"Flat vector\",\"value\":\"flat-vector\",\"prompt\":\"flat-vector: clean flat vector shapes, minimal shading, mascot-logo ready.\",\"imageUrl\":\"https://imagine-public.x.ai/agent-skills/mascot_maker/style_flat_vector.jpg?v=3\"},{\"label\":\"Painterly\",\"value\":\"painterly\",\"prompt\":\"painterly: rich hand-painted illustration with soft rendered volume.\",\"imageUrl\":\"https://imagine-public.x.ai/agent-skills/mascot_maker/style_painterly.jpg?v=3\"},{\"label\":\"Pixel art\",\"value\":\"pixel\",\"prompt\":\"pixel: true chunky pixel art, hard stair-stepped edges, a limited palette, no anti-aliasing.\",\"imageUrl\":\"https://imagine-public.x.ai/agent-skills/mascot_maker/style_pixel.jpg?v=3\"}]},{\"id\":\"background\",\"label\":\"Background\",\"description\":\"What sits behind the mascot. Transparent (keyable) by default so it drops straight into a game or Character Sprite Maker.\",\"default\":\"transparent\",\"options\":[{\"label\":\"Transparent\",\"value\":\"transparent\",\"prompt\":\"transparent: deliver the mascot as a clean cutout on a fully transparent background (alpha), edges tight, ready to composite.\",\"imageUrl\":\"https://imagine-public.x.ai/agent-skills/mascot_maker/bg_transparent.png?v=1\"},{\"label\":\"Chroma key\",\"value\":\"chroma-magenta\",\"prompt\":\"chroma-magenta: a solid flat chroma-key magenta (#FF00FF) fill for easy keying (use solid green if the character itself is magenta).\",\"imageUrl\":\"https://imagine-public.x.ai/agent-skills/mascot_maker/bg_chroma_magenta.png?v=1\"}]}],\"imageInputs\":[],\"textInputs\":[{\"id\":\"concept\",\"label\":\"Mascot concept\",\"required\":true,\"multiline\":true,\"placeholder\":\"The character in a line, e.g. \\\"a punk shark in a leather jacket\\\" or \\\"a tiny mushroom knight\\\".\",\"example\":\"a punk shark in a leather jacket\"},{\"id\":\"color_palette\",\"label\":\"Color palette (optional)\",\"required\":false,\"placeholder\":\"Optional: dominant colors, e.g. \\\"electric blue + storm grey + yellow\\\".\"},{\"id\":\"notes\",\"label\":\"Notes (optional)\",\"required\":false,\"placeholder\":\"Anything specific: a signature pose, an accessory, a vibe.\"}],\"inputOrder\":[\"concept\",\"art_style\",\"color_palette\",\"background\",\"notes\"],\"promptTemplate\":\"$a2\",\"variants\":[{\"inputs\":null,\"output\":\"https://imagine-public.x.ai/agent-skills/mascot_maker/variants/MSC-01-output.jpg\"},{\"inputs\":null,\"output\":\"https://imagine-public.x.ai/agent-skills/mascot_maker/variants/MSC-11-output.jpg\"},{\"inputs\":null,\"output\":\"https://imagine-public.x.ai/agent-skills/mascot_maker/variants/MSC-25-output.jpg\"},{\"inputs\":null,\"output\":\"https://imagine-public.x.ai/agent-skills/mascot_maker/variants/MSC-50-output.jpg\"},{\"inputs\":null,\"output\":\"https://imagine-public.x.ai/agent-skills/mascot_maker/variants/MSC-17-output.jpg\"}]},{\"id\":\"imagine-editorial-poster\",\"title\":\"Editorial Product Poster\",\"description\":\"Turn a single product photo into an art-directed, editorial typographic poster.\",\"category\":\"Marketing\",\"coverImageUrl\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/imagine-public.x.ai/agent-skills/editorial/editorial_cover.jpg?v=2\",\"coverVerticalImageUrl\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/imagine-public.x.ai/agent-skills/editorial/editorial_veritcal.jpg\",\"settings\":[{\"label\":\"Aspect\",\"value\":\"9:16\"}],\"presetInputs\":[{\"id\":\"mode\",\"label\":\"Mode\",\"required\":true,\"options\":[{\"label\":\"Maximal\",\"value\":\"MAXIMAL\",\"imageUrl\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/imagine-public.x.ai/agent-skills/editorial/maximal_editorial.jpg?v=2\",\"prompt\":\"MAXIMAL (layered, maximalist — equivalent to \\\"Prompt 1\\\")\\n- Signature move: TEXT-BEHIND-PRODUCT OVERLAP. Blow the hero word up huge and layer the product in front\\n  of it so they overlap — this is what creates depth. The hero word MAY be repeated, stacked, or ghosted\\n  behind the product (e.g. a stacked wordmark, a ghosted echo) when it elevates the piece.\\n- Staging is either SURREAL scale-play (product placed in an unexpected oversized/world context to stop the\\n  scroll) OR surgically clean (product floating in near-empty space). No timid middle ground.\\n- Lean into richness within the single color world: full tonal commitment, confident bold+script pairing.\"},{\"label\":\"Minimal\",\"value\":\"MINIMAL\",\"imageUrl\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/imagine-public.x.ai/agent-skills/editorial/minimal_editorial.jpg?v=2\",\"prompt\":\"MINIMAL (disciplined, single-archetype — equivalent to \\\"Prompt 2\\\")\\nPick the ONE composition archetype that best fits this product:\\n  1. Single hero word overlapping the product (default).\\n  2. Hero word split in two around the product (top-left / bottom-right).\\n  3. Script word + bold display word paired (e.g. \\\"tasty\\\" over \\\"MORNING\\\").\\n  4. Clean minimal: small hero word, product centered, lots of empty space.\\n  5. Color-flooded: badge + headline + product + CTA on one centered axis.\\n\\nAVOID (critical):\\n- Do NOT repeat or stack the same word. State the hero word ONCE. Do not tile or echo the brand name to fill\\n  the background. (A single faint ghost behind the product is allowed only rarely — assume NOT for this poster\\n  unless it clearly elevates it.)\\n- No more than three type families. No rainbow of color. No mid-sized filler text. No busy backgrounds or clip-art.\\n- Staging: surgically clean (product floating in calm space) OR one surreal scale-play idea — nothing in between.\"}]}],\"imageInputs\":[{\"id\":\"product\",\"label\":\"Product image\",\"required\":true,\"minImages\":1,\"maxImages\":1}],\"textInputs\":[{\"id\":\"hero\",\"label\":\"Hero\",\"required\":true,\"placeholder\":\"e.g. RADIANCE\"},{\"id\":\"subhead\",\"label\":\"Subtext\",\"required\":true,\"placeholder\":\"e.g. Vitamin C brightening serum\"},{\"id\":\"labels\",\"label\":\"Fine prints (3-5 words)\",\"placeholder\":\"e.g. VEGAN, CRUELTY-FREE, 30ML\"}],\"promptTemplate\":\"$a3\",\"variants\":[{\"inputs\":\"https://imagine-public.x.ai/agent-skills/editorial/variants/EDP-01-input.jpg\",\"output\":\"https://imagine-public.x.ai/agent-skills/editorial/variants/EDP-01-output.jpg\"},{\"inputs\":\"https://imagine-public.x.ai/agent-skills/editorial/variants/EDP-44-input.jpg\",\"output\":\"https://imagine-public.x.ai/agent-skills/editorial/variants/EDP-44-output.jpg\"},{\"inputs\":\"https://imagine-public.x.ai/agent-skills/editorial/variants/EDP-16-input.jpg\",\"output\":\"https://imagine-public.x.ai/agent-skills/editorial/variants/EDP-16-output.jpg\"},{\"inputs\":\"https://imagine-public.x.ai/agent-skills/editorial/variants/EDP-13-input.jpg?v=20260723\",\"output\":\"https://imagine-public.x.ai/agent-skills/editorial/variants/EDP-13-output.jpg\"},{\"inputs\":\"https://imagine-public.x.ai/agent-skills/editorial/variants/EDP-28-input.jpg\",\"output\":\"https://imagine-public.x.ai/agent-skills/editorial/variants/EDP-28-output.jpg\"}]},{\"id\":\"imagine-professional-headshot\",\"title\":\"Professional Headshot\",\"description\":\"Turn any casual photo into a LinkedIn-grade professional headshot — unmistakably the same person, with professionalized attire, backdrop, and lighting.\",\"category\":\"Photo Tools\",\"settings\":[{\"label\":\"Mode\",\"value\":\"Image\"},{\"label\":\"Images\",\"value\":\"1\"}],\"presetInputs\":[{\"id\":\"attire\",\"label\":\"Attire\",\"required\":true,\"options\":[{\"label\":\"Business Suit\",\"value\":\"suit\",\"prompt\":\"a fully tailored dark suit JACKET worn with a crisp white or light-blue dress shirt and a tie (for a woman: the tailored dark suit jacket over a formal silk blouse) - unmistakably formal business dress; the jacket and tie/formal blouse must be clearly visible\",\"imageUrl\":\"https://imagine-public.x.ai/agent-skills/professional_headshot/attire_suit_sq.jpg\"},{\"label\":\"Business casual\",\"value\":\"business-casual\",\"prompt\":\"business casual with NO tie and NO formal suit: an open-collar shirt or blouse (top button open), worn alone, under a fine knit sweater, or under a soft unstructured blazer - clearly more relaxed than a formal suit at a glance\",\"imageUrl\":\"https://imagine-public.x.ai/agent-skills/professional_headshot/attire_bizcasual_sq.jpg\"},{\"label\":\"Neutral\",\"value\":\"neutral\",\"prompt\":\"Minimal, modern neutral clothing, and clearly neither a suit nor an office shirt.\",\"imageUrl\":\"https://imagine-public.x.ai/agent-skills/professional_headshot/attire_creative_sq.jpg?v=2\"}]}],\"textInputs\":[{\"id\":\"notes\",\"label\":\"Notes (optional)\",\"required\":false,\"placeholder\":\"Optional: anything specific you want\"}],\"imageInputs\":[{\"id\":\"sourcePhoto\",\"label\":\"Your photo\",\"description\":\"A casual photo of you — selfie, candid, anything where your face is clearly visible.\",\"required\":true,\"minImages\":1,\"maxImages\":1}],\"inputOrder\":[\"sourcePhoto\",\"attire\"],\"promptTemplate\":\"$a4\",\"coverImageUrl\":\"https://imagine-public.x.ai/agent-skills/professional_headshot/professional_headshot_cover.jpg?v=9\",\"coverVerticalImageUrl\":\"https://imagine-public.x.ai/agent-skills/professional_headshot/professional_headshot_vertical.jpg?v=9\",\"variants\":[]},{\"id\":\"imagine-room-staging\",\"title\":\"Room staging (empty to furnished)\",\"description\":\"Virtually stage an empty room with furniture and decor in a chosen staging style.\",\"category\":\"Interior\",\"coverImageUrl\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/imagine-public.x.ai/agent-skills/room_staging/Template_Cover_Room%20stating.jpg?v=3\",\"coverVerticalImageUrl\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/imagine-public.x.ai/agent-skills/room_staging/room_staging_vertical.jpg?v=1\",\"presetInputs\":[{\"id\":\"style\",\"label\":\"Style\",\"description\":\"Pick the staging style.\",\"required\":true,\"options\":[{\"label\":\"Transitional\",\"value\":\"Transitional\",\"imageUrl\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/imagine-public.x.ai/agent-skills/room_staging/Room%20stating_Neutral_Transitional.jpg\",\"prompt\":\"Transitional — Warm neutrals (greige, taupe, cream, soft white) with one muted accent (soft blue or sage) — mixed wood and upholstery, brushed metal, natural fibers — comfortable classic-but-clean pieces: a track-arm sofa, a pair of accent chairs, a wood coffee table, a console — textured throws and cushions, a large neutral rug, calm abstract art, a plant or two, warm table lamps — soft, even, inviting light. The crowd-pleaser default: comfortable and current, never trendy or polarizing. Works for almost any listing.\"},{\"label\":\"Contemporary\",\"value\":\"Contemporary\",\"imageUrl\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/imagine-public.x.ai/agent-skills/room_staging/Room%20stating_Contemporary.jpg\",\"prompt\":\"Contemporary — Crisp neutrals (white, grey, charcoal) with clean black accents — glass, matte and polished metal, smooth surfaces — a sleek low-profile sofa, clean-lined chairs, a simple coffee table, a minimal console — a few cushions, one large modern artwork, a sculptural plant, a statement fixture, clear surfaces — bright, clean, modern light. Current and widely appealing; ideal for new builds and condos.\"},{\"label\":\"Modern Farmhouse\",\"value\":\"Modern Farmhouse\",\"imageUrl\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/imagine-public.x.ai/agent-skills/room_staging/Room%20stating_Modern%20farmhouse.jpg\",\"prompt\":\"Modern Farmhouse — Warm white, cream, soft greige with black accents and natural wood — light and reclaimed wood, matte black metal, woven baskets — a comfortable slipcovered sofa, a wood-and-metal coffee table, cozy accent chairs, a console — linen and chunky-knit textiles, a jute or wool rug, simple greenery, a few framed prints, black or lantern-style fixtures — warm, cozy, sunlit. Familiar and welcoming; strong in suburban and family markets.\"},{\"label\":\"Scandinavian / Light Minimalist\",\"value\":\"Scandinavian / Light Minimalist\",\"imageUrl\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/imagine-public.x.ai/agent-skills/room_staging/Room%20stating_Scandinavian%20Light%20Minimalist.jpg\",\"prompt\":\"Scandinavian / Light Minimalist — Bright white with pale wood and soft muted accents — light oak/birch, white, natural fibers — simple low-profile furniture on tapered legs: a light sofa, a slim coffee table, an accent chair — a soft throw, a sheepskin, one rug, a single large plant, minimal art — abundant soft natural light; airy and uncluttered. Makes small rooms feel bigger and brighter; great for apartments, condos, and younger buyers.\"},{\"label\":\"Coastal\",\"value\":\"Coastal\",\"imageUrl\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/imagine-public.x.ai/agent-skills/room_staging/Room%20stating_Coastal.jpg\",\"prompt\":\"Coastal — Crisp white with soft blue, seafoam, and sandy beige — driftwood-toned wood, rattan, jute, rope, linen — a relaxed slipcovered sofa, woven accent chairs, a light wood coffee table — breezy linen textiles, a natural-fiber rug, subtle coastal art, sheer curtains, a few plants — bright, sunny, airy light. Essential for beach, lake, and waterfront listings; serene and light.\"},{\"label\":\"Mid-Century Modern\",\"value\":\"Mid-Century Modern\",\"imageUrl\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/imagine-public.x.ai/agent-skills/room_staging/Room%20staging_Mid-century%20modern.jpg\",\"prompt\":\"Mid-Century Modern — Warm neutrals with walnut and restrained mustard/teal accents — walnut, leather, brass — a tapered-leg sofa, an organic curved accent chair, a low walnut coffee table — a geometric rug, a couple of cushions, retro-leaning art, a sculptural lamp, a plant — warm even light. For urban, design-conscious buyers and period homes.\"},{\"label\":\"Modern Luxe\",\"value\":\"Modern Luxe\",\"imageUrl\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/imagine-public.x.ai/agent-skills/room_staging/Room%20staging_Modern%20luxe.jpg\",\"prompt\":\"Modern Luxe — Soft neutrals (greige, ivory, taupe) with deep accents and gold/brass — marble, velvet, brass, polished wood, glass — a plush sophisticated sofa, elegant accent chairs, a marble-top coffee table, a statement console — velvet cushions, a high-end rug, large framed art, a sculptural chandelier, fresh flowers — warm, layered, flattering light. For premium listings where staging must justify the price.\"},{\"label\":\"Industrial\",\"value\":\"Industrial\",\"imageUrl\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/imagine-public.x.ai/agent-skills/room_staging/Room%20staging__Industrrial.jpg?v=20260723\",\"prompt\":\"Industrial — Warm greys and browns with black metal, kept inviting not raw — exposed-brick feel, wood, blackened steel, leather — a leather or neutral sofa, a metal-and-wood coffee table, an accent chair — a textured rug, softening cushions, framed prints, Edison-style fixtures, greenery — warm directional light. Lofts and warehouse conversions; soften the rawness so it still feels like home.\"},{\"label\":\"Rustic / Mountain\",\"value\":\"Rustic / Mountain\",\"imageUrl\":\"https://stora